  m_Name: PendulumGate
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: GravityBox.Gameplay::GravityBox.Gameplay.LevelDefinition
  Id: steel-lab-pendulumgate
  DisplayIndex: 20
  DisplayName: Between the beats
  Shape: 19
  TeachingHint: Set the pendulum swinging. Leave the waiting pocket when the passage
    clears.
  Environment: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 82e0ce24addfe4fc89b8bbd0db998aea, type: 2}
  Prefab: {fileID: 880782998605753593, guid: ec0cdcefc881f4377b1da3c400029c56, type: 3}
  RotationMode: 1
  InitialLocalVelocity: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
  ParSeconds: 0
  Tutorial: 0
  DesignerSolution: A weighted pendulum blocks a real aperture in the partition.
    Use sideways rotation to swing it clear, then feed the ball through using the
    other tilt axis. Stabilizing the pendulum at an open angle is a valid physical
    solution. Missed timing is recoverable on the enclosure floor. Shared exit assist
    pulls the ball through an unobstructed opening within 40 mm. This is deliberate
    gameplay assistance; the entire sphere must still physically clear the bore before
    completion.
